<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Federal Flour 6-mth net up 98 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Federal Flour 6-mth net up 98 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  58.84   vs	  29.71</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 26.37   vs	  13.31</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,769.63   vs     1,717.61</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    75.60   vs	  39.86</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.09   vs  less   1.58</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   14.88   vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Federal Flour Mills Bhd is involved in flour milling and oil palm businesses.</p>
